1
00:00:04,600 --> 00:00:09,600
Interfaces that show up when you need them.

2
00:00:11,400 --> 00:00:21,600
Ask for something. A real, accessible interface is drawn for that moment, in your design system, and checked before you see it.

3
00:00:22,600 --> 00:00:27,800
Thirteen design systems' real tokens. Twelve templates to make your own. Two of them hand-drawn.

4
00:00:28,400 --> 00:00:31,700
Four products, four design systems: Material 3, shadcn/ui, GOV.UK, Polaris.

5
00:00:32,800 --> 00:00:38,900
Screen readers read exactly what agents press.

6
00:00:39,600 --> 00:00:43,700
Checked in every design system, light and dark, phone and desktop, before anyone sees it.

7
00:00:44,600 --> 00:00:49,600
Designers write the rest of the product the same way.

8
00:00:50,200 --> 00:00:55,700
The shell too. Authored once, never touched by a generator.

9
00:00:57,200 --> 00:01:05,600
Open spec. Any model, or none. Your design system. Your code: React, Web Components, or your own renderer.

10
00:01:07,200 --> 00:01:11,800
polyxd.com. Open source, Apache-2.0.
